                <pb facs="1190" n="1184" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1184"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr.
                            Stevens.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-02-22"><hi rendition="#italic">February 22,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The treaty of annexation still pending in Senate. In addition to previous
                    instructions you will, in coöperation with naval authorities, support
                    Provisional Government in maintaining security to life and property and good
                    order until action can be taken on treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
